    8: /* ── Dev-mode redaction ────────────────────────────────────
    9:    The 'dev' role has full ST-equivalent access but every character and
   10:    player name shown in the UI is replaced with a black block so the
   11:    developer can work on the app without seeing real player PII.
   12:    Redaction happens at the display-helper level; underlying data on
   13:    the character objects is untouched so lookups, sorts, and API
   14:    round-trips all still work. */
